-- ============================================================================
--  IntMap · news sources — regional, trade and official feeds for the long event record (news-event-history)
--  docs/NEWS-EVENTS.md §19.4
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
--  EVERY row here was fetched on 2026-11-20 (plain User-Agent, 20 s timeout, redirects followed) and kept only if
--  HTTP 200, >= 5 items, the newest item <= 3 days old and >= 90% of the item links on the outlet's own host. The
--  hosts in `domains` are the hosts those links actually carried (ingest attributes an article by its canonical
--  host, never by which feed delivered it — §3). Measurements and the ~410 URLs that FAILED (so nobody probes them
--  again) are in dev-notes/2026-11-20-news-event-history.md.
--  Not added although probed: TSMC / Intel / Shell / TotalEnergies / ASML / Cheniere / QatarEnergy / METI (403, 404,
--  stale or HTML, not a feed), Nikkei Asia (items carry no date), Viet Nam News (the feed is UTF-16).
--  terms_url is NULL: it is written only when the terms page was fetched and read (§3). attribution names the outlet.
--  Idempotent: an existing source or feed is left as the operator set it.
-- ============================================================================
on conflict (id) do nothing;

on conflict (url) do nothing;
